{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QuantumObservableUniverses.QDilogarithmExists","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QuantumObservableUniverses.QDilogarithmExists","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.QAnalysisUniquenessCounterexamples"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QDilogarithm.exists_of_addZeroClass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QDilogarithm.exists_of_addZeroClass","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-dilogarithm-exists.lean#L53-L62","doc":"**Existence of the q-dilogarithm structure over an `AddZeroClass`.**\n\nInhabitation of `QDilogarithm H`, with no axiom.  See the module\ndocstring: this is strictly weaker than the shuffle-recursion\nconstruction the proposition's prose describes, and the `Add`-only\nform it replaces is false. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:q-dilogarithm-exists","label":"prop:q-dilogarithm-exists","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-dilogarithm-exists.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}